":"年が離れており主人公とは違う学園に通う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女系家族で肩身の狭い思いをする兄をかばってくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悲しいかな、主人公にとって唯一の癒し系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無邪気さゆえに色々なところが無防備で兄をヤキモキさせる"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7965","sourceWorkId":"17596","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく純粋で素直な、ロリプニ可愛いお兄ちゃん大好き妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年が離れており主人公らとは違う学園に通う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女系家族で肩身の狭い思いをする兄を 「お兄ちゃんをいじめないであげて！」 とかばってくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悲しいかな、主人公にとって唯一の癒し系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無邪気さゆえに色々なところが無防備で兄をヤキモキさせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「エッチの時に男の人がどうしたら喜ぶかなって思って……その、練習を……うぅ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"cupSize":[{"comparisonValue":"e","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32845","value":"E"},{"comparisonValue":"eカップ","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49138","value":"Eカップ"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60d3d429037a51e1f01d1587ad0ebffd6c9a05cb5b0337ac19be81e016e279df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/efedf58588673295449b0fa7f100cb33ccccc7d3050efb31099640e57cf4fd0d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎未來","creatorId":"vndb:s986","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s986","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s986","name":"尾崎 未來","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:198759:49138:13776:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32846","characterName":"市位 夢子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49139","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"198759"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7966"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32846"},"originalCharacterName":"市位 夢子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","sourc