izes over texts with her, she gives him relationship advice like, “Want to make progress? Get on your knees right there. Don't underestimate girls.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her actions are bold, but deep down she's kind and takes good care of others. She's a heavy drinker who's constantly drunk."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32847"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰もが見惚れるセクシーでグラマラスな長女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歩く傍若無人で、主に弟を振り回す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女とのメールに悩む弟に「進展したい？ ちょっとそこに正座。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子なめんな」と恋愛相談にのるなど、行動は男前だが根は優しく面倒見がよい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しょっちゅう酔っ払っている鯨飲の酒好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7967","sourceWorkId":"17596","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰もが見惚れるセクシーでグラマラスな長女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歩く傍若無人で主に弟をよく振り回す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女とのメールに悩む弟に"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「進展したい？　ちょっとそこに正座。女子なめんな」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"と恋愛相談にのるなど、行動は男前だが根は優しく面倒見がよい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しょっちゅう酔っ払っている鯨飲の酒好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「アタシにお願いする時はヴィクトリアお姉様と呼びなさい」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49140"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"i","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7967","sourceWorkId":"17596","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"cupSize":[{"comparisonValue":"i","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32847","value":"I"},{"comparisonValue":"i","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7967","sourceWorkId":"17596","value":"I"},{"comparisonValue":"iカップ","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49140","value":"Iカップ"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be27ae285f8aefa96bf200c4afbdf0930d4d8074c026484ed088f8379a4086b0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f601b4e0d984bf462fd8e0ac8172f1d593b5910220f0e870d02ac1fb60db13f6.webp","width":